  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "（桑山千雪と和泉愛依を見張っている間に、\r\n探偵たちは手際よく、解毒剤の注射を済ませていく）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "（最後に俺がアンプルの中身を摂取したころには、\r\n少しだけ、安堵のようなものが漂っていた）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00684",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032320010,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ねえ、千雪さん……\r\nどうして……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "057",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103232/4901032320010"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032320020,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "一番先に『Ａ』の元にたどり着いて\r\n実力を証明したんだから殺す必要なんて……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103232/4901032320020"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032320030,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "ち、千雪さん……\r\n……えと──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103232/4901032320030"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032320040,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "なんか……\r\nどうしてもって、理由……あるんだよね……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103232/4901032320040"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032320050,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103232/4901032320050"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032320060,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "残念だけど、大した理由じゃないの",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103232/4901032320060"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032320070,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……『Ａ』の財産と、\r\nこのファイルをひとりじめしたかっただけ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103232/4901032320070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "そんな……\r\n『Ａ』は病に冒されていました",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "殺さなくても、真っ先にたどり着いたあなたを認め、\r\n然るべき時が来たら譲っていたはずです……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032320080,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "あなたは『Ａ』の傍にいたのに、\r\n彼のことが全然わかっていないのね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103232/4901032320080"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032320090,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "昨晩、『Ａ』は……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103232/4901032320090"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032320100,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "部屋を訪れた私に、どうやってこの場所にたどり着いたか\r\n聞かせてほしいと言った",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103232/4901032320100"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032320110,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "私は……全てを話したわ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103232/4901032320110"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032320120,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "招待状と、客室棟の地図に隠された謎\r\nそれが何か、お弟子さんは知らないでしょう？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103232/4901032320120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "ええ、教えて欲しいです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032320130,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "そう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103232/4901032320130"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032320140,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "教えません、悔しいから♪",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103232/4901032320140"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032320150,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "でも、台所をジャックしてクッキーを焼いていたのは……\r\n他の探偵さんたちの謎解きを邪魔するため",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103232/4901032320150"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032320160,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "その話をしたら『Ａ』は──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103232/4901032320160"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00000",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 300,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00681",
    "fg": "001921",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "fgEffect": "fade",
    "fgEffectTime": 1000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032320170,
    "speaker": "『Ａ』",
    "text": "なるほど\r\nなかなかの立ち回りだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103232/4901032320170"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032320180,
    "speaker": "『Ａ』",
    "text": "……では、最終試験を行うとしよう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103232/4901032320180"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032320190,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "最終試験、ですか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103232/4901032320190"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032320200,
    "speaker": "『Ａ』",
    "text": "なに、そう難しいことはない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103232/4901032320200"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032320210,
    "speaker": "『Ａ』",
    "text": "……私を殺して、\r\n誰にも知られずにこの館を出ること",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103232/4901032320210"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032320220,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040160020",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "special_communications/490103232/4901032320220"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032320230,
    "speaker": "『Ａ』",
    "text": "どうだろう\r\nそろそろエピローグといきたいところでね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103232/4901032320230"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032320240,
    "speaker": "『Ａ』",
    "text": "筆を進めよう\r\n後継者は────",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103232/4901032320240"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00000",
    "fg": "fade_out",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032320250,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "それで……\r\n『Ａ』さんを……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103232/4901032320250"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032320260,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……うん、そういうこと\r\nいわゆる嘱託殺人……ってことになるのかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103232/4901032320260"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032320270,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "あ……あの……！\r\nちょ、ちょっと待ってください……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103232/4901032320270"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00439",
    "fg": "001921",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "fgEffect": "fade",
    "fgEffectTime": 1000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
